jemdocx
=======

jemdocx is a maintained fork of jemdoc 0.7.3, originally created by Jacob
Mattingley.

Original jemdoc implementation:
  Copyright (C) 2007-2012 Jacob Mattingley
  https://github.com/jem/jemdoc

The LaTeX equation portions of the original implementation were initially
based on latexmath2png by Kamil Kisiel.

jemdocx modernization:
  Copyright (C) 2026 Yutao Tang
  https://github.com/tangyutao/jemdocx

The 2026 modifications include the Python 3 port, UTF-8 file handling,
MathJax 4 support, command-line modernization, tests, continuous integration,
and documentation restructuring.

